    "title": "URL shortener",
    "requirementsAndConstraints": "Create short links and resolve redirects without waiting for click reporting.\nRecord click events for later analytics.",
    "assumptionsAndOpenQuestions": "Expected traffic and cache hit rate are not specified. Confirm redirect volume and retention requirements before sizing the system.",
    "decisionsAndTradeoffs": "Use a cache for frequent mappings backed by the URL database; a cache miss adds a database read. Send click events to a queue so reporting is off the redirect path; analytics become eventually consistent."
